    "reviews": [
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJbdM4cg0BBDQRjcgw951Fs3U/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsNU1VdE5aa0U0UzNGcFIzbzRXSFJ5VlZWeGRVRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "10 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "再次踏入 Venedia Grancaffe，看著窗外熟悉的景緻，不禁感嘆風景依舊，人事全非。廚房換了主廚，Chef Bjoern見離開了很久，本帶著幾分忐忑，但那道招牌紅蝦意粉一上桌，疑慮便煙消雲散。紅蝦肉質依然維持著相當高的水準，鮮甜彈牙；最令人驚喜的是意粉的掛汁效果依舊出色，濃郁的醬汁緊緊鎖住每一根麵條，每一口都飽滿入味。餐後的提拉米蘇也沒有讓人失望，浸泡的手指餅濕潤度適中，濃郁的咖啡酒香在舌尖散開。雖然掌勺之人已變，但那份對味道的堅持似乎未曾改變，這或許就是在變幻時光中，對食客最好的慰藉。\n\nReturning to Venedia Grancaffe, the familiar scenery contrasts with the knowledge that the chef has changed. However, the Red Prawn Spaghetti proves that the kitchen’s high standards remain untouched. The prawns are fresh, and the pasta sauce still coats the noodles perfectly, delivering a rich and consistent flavor. The experience concludes beautifully with the Tiramisu, which retains its robust and aromatic coffee notes. It is comforting to find that while the staff may be new, the exceptional taste endures.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "再次踏入 Venedia Grancaffe，看著窗外熟悉的景緻，不禁感嘆風景依舊，人事全非。廚房換了主廚，Chef Bjoern見離開了很久，本帶著幾分忐忑，但那道招牌紅蝦意粉一上桌，疑慮便煙消雲散。紅蝦肉質依然維持著相當高的水準，鮮甜彈牙；最令人驚喜的是意粉的掛汁效果依舊出色，濃郁的醬汁緊緊鎖住每一根麵條，每一口都飽滿入味。餐後的提拉米蘇也沒有讓人失望，浸泡的手指餅濕潤度適中，濃郁的咖啡酒香在舌尖散開。雖然掌勺之人已變，但那份對味道的堅持似乎未曾改變，這或許就是在變幻時光中，對食客最好的慰藉。\n\nReturning to Venedia Grancaffe, the familiar scenery contrasts with the knowledge that the chef has changed. However, the Red Prawn Spaghetti proves that the kitchen’s high standards remain untouched. The prawns are fresh, and the pasta sauce still coats the noodles perfectly, delivering a rich and consistent flavor. The experience concludes beautifully with the Tiramisu, which retains its robust and aromatic coffee notes. It is comforting to find that while the staff may be new, the exceptional taste endures.",
